-- Agreed tests (verification step 2, plain SQL on PostgreSQL) for AdventureWorks2025 Sales.vSalesPerson.
-- GENERATED by npm run agreed-tests -- --object Sales.vSalesPerson. Do not edit by hand: change the fixed cases
